WEBVTT

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:02.792
Check out faster with the <b>keyboard</b>

00:00:02.937 --> 00:00:07.829
All shortcuts are in your account menu, under <b>Teclas rápidas</b> (shortcuts)

00:00:08.007 --> 00:00:13.158
Type or scan a code and press <b>Enter</b>: it goes into the cart

00:00:13.327 --> 00:00:18.718
<b>F2</b> takes you straight to the cash received

00:00:18.868 --> 00:00:23.741
And <b>Esc</b> clears the search or closes the open window
